  <jpcrp_cor:OfficialTitleOrPositionInformationAboutExecutiveDirectors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E00892-000WeeSiewKimMember">

取締役


代表執行役共同社長

</jpcrp_cor:OfficialTitleOrPositionInformationAboutExecutiveDirectors>
